{"judgments": [
  {"clause_id": "c017",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": "The royalty is 19% of \"the lowest wholesale price ... payable by PRI's customers\", a base that is undefined for licensing or non-wholesale exploitations of Audio-Visual Devices. \"Net Sales\" and \"lowest wholesale price\" together leave the computation open where there is no conventional wholesale customer.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.33},
     {"issue": "Sub-paragraph (a) covers only devices \"sold by PRI\", while 7.11(b) and 7.11(c) (c018, c019) cover sales by \"PRI and/or its affiliates\", so United States sales by an affiliate arguably fall outside every rate. The asymmetry is only visible when the three sub-paragraphs are read together.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.30}
   ]},
  {"clause_id": "c018",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": "The territories are enumerated exhaustively (\"United Kingdom, West Germany, France, Canada, Benelux, Australia, New Zealand and Japan\") with no catch-all, and terms such as \"Benelux\" and \"West Germany\" have shifting geographic content over the life of the deal. Which country a sale is \"for distribution in\" is left to be determined.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.28},
     {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.14}
   ]},
  {"clause_id": "c019",
